WEBVTT

00:00:21.203 --> 00:00:22.443
Take this one home.

00:00:22.523 --> 00:00:25.203
And make sure his mom knows
what he's been doing.

00:00:25.283 --> 00:00:27.163
I can help you.
You're making a mist...

00:00:27.243 --> 00:00:29.323
The injured jumper.
You sent paramedics?

00:00:29.403 --> 00:00:30.363
They picked him up.

00:00:30.523 --> 00:00:32.883
The blast in that building
was caused by Bomb Voyage

00:00:32.963 --> 00:00:34.523
who I caught
robbing the vault.

00:00:34.603 --> 00:00:37.163
We might nab him
if we set up a perimeter.

00:00:37.243 --> 00:00:39.203
He got away?
Well, yeah.

00:00:39.283 --> 00:00:40.363
Skippy here
made sure of that.

00:00:40.443 --> 00:00:41.523
Incrediboy.

00:00:41.643 --> 00:00:43.363
You're not
affiliated with me!

00:00:43.443 --> 00:00:45.163
Holy smokes, I'm late.

00:00:45.243 --> 00:00:47.483
Listen,
I've gotta be somewhere.

00:00:48.123 --> 00:00:49.403
What about Bomb Voyage?

00:00:49.483 --> 00:00:51.003
Any other night,
I'd go after him,

00:00:51.083 --> 00:00:53.323
but I really gotta go.
Don't worry.

00:00:53.443 --> 00:00:55.163
We'll get him!
Eventually!

00:00:57.923 --> 00:00:59.963
(CHURCH ORGAN MUSIC PLAYS)

00:01:01.643 --> 00:01:03.883
Is the night
still young?
You're very late.

00:01:03.963 --> 00:01:05.723
How do I look? Good?

00:01:05.803 --> 00:01:07.403
The mask.
You still got the mask.

00:01:08.403 --> 00:01:09.803
(CRACKS NECK)

00:01:10.243 --> 00:01:11.403
Showtime.

00:01:15.283 --> 00:01:19.203
Robert Parr, will you
have this woman to be
your lawful wedded wife?

00:01:19.283 --> 00:01:22.363
You're late. When you
asked if I was doing
anything later,

00:01:22.443 --> 00:01:24.203
I didn't realize
you'd forgotten.

00:01:24.283 --> 00:01:25.763
I thought it was
playful banter.

00:01:25.843 --> 00:01:26.843
It was.

00:01:26.963 --> 00:01:28.243
Cutting it close,
don't you think?

00:01:28.323 --> 00:01:30.843
You need to be
more flexible.

00:01:30.923 --> 00:01:33.283
I love you,
but if we're gonna
make this work,

00:01:33.403 --> 00:01:35.603
you've gotta be more
than Mr. Incredible.

00:01:35.683 --> 00:01:37.683
You know that.
Don't you?

00:01:37.803 --> 00:01:39.163
...so long as
you both shall live?

00:01:39.283 --> 00:01:40.283
I do.

00:01:40.363 --> 00:01:43.283
I pronounce this couple
husband and wife.

00:01:43.523 --> 00:01:45.483
(PEOPLE CHEERING
AND WHISTLING)

00:01:46.043 --> 00:01:48.243
As long as
we both shall live.

00:01:48.323 --> 00:01:49.523
No matter what happens.

00:01:49.643 --> 00:01:54.643
Hey, come on.
We're superheroes.
What could happen?

00:01:56.403 --> 00:01:59.883
ANNOUNCER: In a stunning
turn of events,
a superhero is being sued

00:02:00.003 --> 00:02:03.803
for saving someone who,
apparently, didn't want
to be saved.

00:02:03.883 --> 00:02:05.123
The plaintiff,
Oliver Sansweet,

00:02:05.203 --> 00:02:08.643
who was foiled in his
attempted suicide
by Mr. Incredible,

00:02:08.723 --> 00:02:12.803
has filed suit against
the famed superhero
in Superior Court.

00:02:12.883 --> 00:02:16.203
Mr. Sansweet didn't ask
to be saved. He didn't
want to be saved.

00:02:16.283 --> 00:02:19.323
The injury received from
Mr. Incredible's "actions,"

00:02:19.403 --> 00:02:20.563
causes him daily pain.

00:02:20.683 --> 00:02:21.643
I saved your life!

00:02:21.723 --> 00:02:24.043
You didn't save my life!
You ruined my death.

00:02:24.123 --> 00:02:25.803
LAWYER: My client
has no comment.

00:02:25.883 --> 00:02:30.563
ANNOUNCER: Another suit
was filed by victims of
the El train accident.

00:02:30.643 --> 00:02:34.083
Incredible's
court losses cost
the government millions.

00:02:34.163 --> 00:02:38.163
And opened the floodgates
for dozens of superhero
lawsuits the world over.

00:02:38.243 --> 00:02:43.203
It is time for their
secret identity to become
their only identity.

00:02:43.283 --> 00:02:46.323
Time for them
to join us,
or go away.

00:02:46.403 --> 00:02:49.323
ANNOUNCER:
Under public pressure,
and the financial burden

00:02:49.403 --> 00:02:51.843
of an ever mounting
series of lawsuits,

00:02:51.923 --> 00:02:56.003
the government quietly
initiated the Superhero
Relocation Program.

00:02:56.083 --> 00:02:57.683
The supers were
granted amnesty

00:02:57.763 --> 00:02:59.523
from responsibility
for past actions,

00:02:59.603 --> 00:03:03.923
in exchange for the
promise to never again
resume hero work.

00:03:04.043 --> 00:03:05.683
Where are they now?

00:03:05.763 --> 00:03:07.523
They are living among us.

00:03:07.603 --> 00:03:10.123
Average citizens,
average heroes.

00:03:10.203 --> 00:03:15.483
Quietly and anonymously
continuing to make the
world a better place.

00:03:16.323 --> 00:03:19.443
Denied? You're
denying my claim?

00:03:20.243 --> 00:03:21.483
I don't understand.

00:03:21.563 --> 00:03:22.843
15 YEARS LATER

00:03:22.963 --> 00:03:24.603
-I have full coverage.
-I'm sorry, Mrs. Hogenson,

00:03:24.763 --> 00:03:27.883
but our liability
is spelled out
in paragraph 17.

00:03:27.963 --> 00:03:29.203
It states clearly...

00:03:29.283 --> 00:03:30.803
(STAMMERING)
I can't pay for this.

00:03:30.923 --> 00:03:32.723
Excuse me.
Claims, Bob Parr.

00:03:32.803 --> 00:03:35.403
I'm calling to celebrate
a momentous occasion.

00:03:35.483 --> 00:03:37.723
We're now officially
moved in.

00:03:37.803 --> 00:03:39.563
Yeah, well,
that's great, honey.

00:03:39.643 --> 00:03:42.043
The last three years
don't count because...

00:03:42.123 --> 00:03:44.483
Because I finally
unpacked the last box.

00:03:44.563 --> 00:03:46.203
Now, it's official.
Ha, ha, ha.

00:03:46.283 --> 00:03:47.643
Why do we have
so much junk?

00:03:47.763 --> 00:03:49.283
Listen,
I've got a client.

00:03:49.403 --> 00:03:52.403
Say no more. Go save
the world one policy
at a time, honey.

00:03:52.483 --> 00:03:54.803
Oh! I gotta go
pick up the kids.
See you tonight.

00:03:55.003 --> 00:03:56.363
Bye, honey.

00:03:56.443 --> 00:03:57.723
Excuse me.
Where were we?

00:03:57.803 --> 00:04:00.643
(SOBBING) I'm
on a fixed income,

00:04:00.723 --> 00:04:02.403
and if you
can't help me,

00:04:02.483 --> 00:04:04.523
I don't know
what I'll do.

00:04:05.123 --> 00:04:06.483
(BLOWS NOSE LOUDLY)

00:04:07.163 --> 00:04:08.323
(SOBBING)

00:04:12.323 --> 00:04:15.603
All right, listen closely.
I'd like to help you,
but I can't.

00:04:15.683 --> 00:04:19.403
I'd like to tell you to
take a copy of your policy
to Norma Wilcox on...

00:04:19.483 --> 00:04:22.443
(WHISPERING)
Norma Wilcox.
W-I-L-C-O-X.

00:04:22.523 --> 00:04:24.763
On the third floor.
But I can't.

00:04:24.843 --> 00:04:28.843
I also do not advise you
to fill out and file
a WS2475 form

00:04:28.963 --> 00:04:30.923
with our legal department
on the second floor.

00:04:31.003 --> 00:04:34.283
I wouldn't expect someone
to get back to you quickly
to resolve the matter.

00:04:34.363 --> 00:04:36.683
I'd like to help,
but there's nothing
I can do.

00:04:36.763 --> 00:04:38.043
Oh, thank you,
young man.

00:04:38.163 --> 00:04:40.843
(SHOUTING) Sorry.
I know you're upset!

00:04:41.003 --> 00:04:42.483
(WHISPERING)
Pretend to be upset.

00:04:42.563 --> 00:04:43.963
(SOBBING)

00:04:46.523 --> 00:04:48.403
Parr!

00:04:48.803 --> 00:04:50.963
You authorized payment
on the Walker policy!

00:04:51.043 --> 00:04:53.123
Someone broke into
their house, Mr. Huph.

00:04:53.203 --> 00:04:54.803
Their policy covers...

00:04:54.883 --> 00:04:56.283
I don't wanna
know about it.

00:04:56.363 --> 00:04:57.723
Don't tell me
about it.

00:04:57.843 --> 00:05:00.163
Tell me how you're
keeping Insuricare
in the black.

00:05:00.243 --> 00:05:02.483
Tell me how that's
possible, with you
writing checks

00:05:02.563 --> 00:05:06.883
to every Harry Hardluck
and Sally Sobstory that
gives you a phone call.

00:05:09.043 --> 00:05:12.043
(OVER PA)
Morning break is over.
Morning break is over.

00:05:16.243 --> 00:05:18.723
I appreciate you
coming down here,
Mrs. Parr.

00:05:19.723 --> 00:05:23.163
What's this about?
Has Dash done
something wrong?

00:05:23.243 --> 00:05:25.163
He's a disruptive
influence

00:05:25.243 --> 00:05:27.363
and he openly mocks me
in front of the class.

00:05:27.443 --> 00:05:28.483
He says.

00:05:28.563 --> 00:05:29.843
Look, I know it's you!

00:05:29.923 --> 00:05:31.523
He puts thumbtacks
on my stool.

00:05:31.643 --> 00:05:33.003
You saw him do this?

00:05:33.083 --> 00:05:35.843
Well... Not really. No.

00:05:35.923 --> 00:05:37.003
Actually, not.

00:05:37.083 --> 00:05:39.163
Oh, then how do
you know it was him?

00:05:39.243 --> 00:05:41.843
I hid a camera.
Yeah, and this time,
I've got him.

